manti.guess <- lapply(MantiCats.telem, FUN = ctmm.guess, interactive = FALSE)

FITS.manti <- lapply(1:length(MantiCats.telem),
               function(i) ctmm.select(MantiCats.telem[[i]],manti.guess[[i]]) )

UDs_Manti <- akde(MantiCats.telem,FITS.manti)

I modeled the code off the example in help("overlap") to make sure it would be correct. The AKDE() function is currently running, so hopefully we will have some UDs that allow me to calculate the overlap soon! Thanks so much for your help! This is a great package and I'm super excited to be able to use it!

